@startuml SEQ_01_MENGELOLA_PROKER
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-01: Mengelola Proker (CRUD)

actor       "Admin / Asisten"  as Admin
boundary    "ProkerPage"       as Page
control     "ProkerController" as Ctrl
entity      "Proker"           as ModelProker
entity      "ProkerPj"         as ModelPj
database    "proker"           as DB

== Lihat Daftar Proker ==

Admin -> Page         : Buka halaman /proker
Page  -> Ctrl         : GET /proker
Ctrl  -> ModelProker  : Query proker berdasarkan kepengurusan lab
ModelProker -> DB     : SELECT proker WHERE kepengurusan_lab_id = ?
DB    --> ModelProker : Data proker
ModelProker --> Ctrl  : Data proker
Ctrl  --> Page        : Render halaman daftar proker
Page  --> Admin       : Tampil tabel daftar proker

== Tambah Proker Baru ==

Admin -> Page         : Isi form & submit
Page  -> Ctrl         : POST /proker\n{nama, status, tanggal, file, pj_user_ids[]}
Ctrl  -> ModelProker  : create({...data, status_pengajuan: 'draft'})
ModelProker -> DB     : INSERT INTO proker
DB    --> ModelProker : Data proker baru
Ctrl  -> ModelPj      : create({proker_id, user_id}) per pj
ModelPj -> DB         : INSERT INTO proker_pj
DB    --> ModelPj     : Berhasil
Ctrl  --> Page        : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Page  --> Admin       : Tampil notifikasi sukses

== Edit Proker ==

Admin -> Page         : Klik Edit, ubah data & submit
Page  -> Ctrl         : PUT /proker/{id} {...data, pj_user_ids[]}
Ctrl  -> ModelProker  : Query proker
ModelProker -> DB     : SELECT proker WHERE id = {id}
DB    --> ModelProker : Data proker
ModelProker --> Ctrl  : Data proker
Ctrl  -> ModelProker  : update({...data})
ModelProker -> DB     : UPDATE proker SET ... WHERE id = {id}
DB    --> ModelProker : Berhasil
Ctrl  -> ModelPj      : delete() WHERE proker_id = ?
ModelPj -> DB         : DELETE FROM proker_pj WHERE proker_id = ?
DB    --> ModelPj     : Berhasil
Ctrl  -> ModelPj      : create({proker_id, user_id}) per pj baru
ModelPj -> DB         : INSERT INTO proker_pj
DB    --> ModelPj     : Berhasil
Ctrl  --> Page        : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Page  --> Admin       : Tampil notifikasi sukses

== Hapus Proker ==

Admin -> Page         : Klik Hapus & konfirmasi
Page  -> Ctrl         : DELETE /proker/{id}
Ctrl  -> ModelProker  : delete()
ModelProker -> DB     : DELETE FROM proker WHERE id = {id}
DB    --> ModelProker : Berhasil
Ctrl  --> Page        : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Page  --> Admin       : Tampil notifikasi sukses

@enduml
